}

### Inhabilitar Usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/disable-user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json  <--- AGREGA ESTA LÍNEA
Authorization: Bearer 176|4Opl9QjI81aEqVpos98wvw1fg0izvxaMb8mGGAnMdd0139cb

{
    "user_id": 26
}

